WEBVTT

00:01:29.419 --> 00:01:33.276
we saw 1,831 overdoses

00:01:34.117 --> 00:01:37.783
[and] 183 deaths from overdose.

00:01:39.338 --> 00:01:43.766
This is the job of my firefighters,
as well as other agencies,

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.235
to respond to that.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.441
(Coughs)

00:01:47.465 --> 00:01:48.615
Excuse me.

00:01:50.239 --> 00:01:55.516
So, watching this epidemic
unfold for several years,

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:57.207
I developed some insight.

00:01:58.342 --> 00:02:03.067
For this disaster, we need to redefine
our job as a first responder.